      "bookHadithIndex": 151,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Bakrah said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'If a Muslim points a weapon at his fellow Muslim, then they are on the brink of Hell, and if he kills him, then they will both fall into it",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4116-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4116-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4116-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0abb6",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 4117,
      "bookHadithIndex": 152,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Bakrah said:\"If two Muslim men bear weapons against each other, then they are both on the brink of Hell. And if one of them kills the other, they will both be in Hell",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4117-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Muquf"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4117-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Muquf"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4117-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0abb7",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 4118,
      "bookHadithIndex": 153,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Musa that:The Prophet [SAW] said: \"If two Muslims confront each other with swords, and one kills the other, they will both be in Hell.\" It was said: \"O Messenger of Allah, (we understand about) the killer, but what about the one who is killed?\" He said: \"He wanted to kill his companion",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4118-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4118-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4118-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0abb8",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 4119,
      "bookHadithIndex": 154,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Musa Al-Ash'ari that:The Prophet [SAW] said: \"If two Muslims confront each other with swords and one of them kills the other, they will both be in Hell",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4119-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4119-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4119-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0abb9",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 4120,
      "bookHadithIndex": 155,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Bakrah that :The Prophet [SAW] said: \"If two Muslims confront each other with swords, each of them wanting to kill the other, they will both be in Hell.\" It was said to him: \"O Messenger of Allah, (we understand about) the killer, but what about the one who is killed?\" He said: \"He was determined to kill his companion",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4120-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4120-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4120-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0abba",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 4121,
      "bookHadithIndex": 156,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Bakrah said:\"The Messenger [SAW] said: 'If two Muslims meet (and fight) with their swords and one of them kills the other, the killer and the slain will both be in Hell",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4121-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4121-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4121-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0abbb",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 4122,
      "bookHadithIndex": 157,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Bakrah said:\"I heard the Messenger of Allah [SAW] say: 'If two Muslims confront each other with their swords and one of them kills the other, both the killer and the slain will be in Hell.'\" They said: \"O Messenger of Allah, (we understand about) the killer, but what about the one who is killed?\" He said: \"He wanted to kill his companion",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4122-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4122-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4122-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
