      "bookHadithIndex": 158,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Bakrah said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'If two Muslims fight with swords, and one of them kills the other, then the killer and the slain will both be in Hell",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4123-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
