    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0abbd",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 4124,
      "bookHadithIndex": 159,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Musa Al-Ash'ari that :The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: \"If two Muslims confront each other with swords and one of them kills the other, then the killer and the slain will both be in Hell.\" A man said: \"O Messenger of Allah, (we understand about) the killer, but what about the one who is killed?\" He said: \"He wanted to kill his companion",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4124-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4124-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4124-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0abbe",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 4125,
      "bookHadithIndex": 160,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibn 'Umar that :The Prophet [SAW] said: \"Do not revert to disbelievers after I am gone, striking the necks of one another (killing one another)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4125-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4125-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4125-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0abbf",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 4126,
      "bookHadithIndex": 161,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ibn 'Umar said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'Do not revert to disbelievers after I am gone, striking the necks of one another (killing one another). No man is to be punished for the sins of his father, or for the sins of his brother",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4126-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4126-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4126-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0abc0",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 4127,
      "bookHadithIndex": 162,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Abdullah said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'Do not revert to disbelievers after I am gone, striking the necks of one another (killing one another). No man is to be punished for the sins of his father, or the sins of his brother",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4127-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4127-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4127-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0abc1",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 4128,
      "bookHadithIndex": 163,
      "text": "It was narrated that Masruq said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'I do not want to see you after I am gone reverting to disbelievers, striking the necks of one another (killing one another). No man is punished for the crime of his father, or the crime of his brother.'\" This is correct",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4128-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4128-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4128-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0abc2",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 4129,
      "bookHadithIndex": 164,
      "text": "It was narrated from Masruq that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: \"Do not revert to disbelievers after I am gone.\" It is Mursal",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4129-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4129-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4129-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0abc3",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 4130,
      "bookHadithIndex": 165,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Bakrah that:The Prophet [SAW] said: \"Do not revert to misguidance after I am gone, striking the necks of one another (killing one another)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4130-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4130-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4130-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0abc4",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 4131,
      "bookHadithIndex": 166,
      "text": "It was narrated from Jarir that :During the Farewell Pilgrimage, the Messenger of Allah [SAW] asked the people to be quiet and listen, and said: \"Do not revert to disbelievers after I am gone, striking the necks of one another (killing one another)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4131-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4131-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4131-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6aadd1a4c9c86f0abc5",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 37,
      "hadithIndex": 4132,
      "bookHadithIndex": 167,
      "text": "It was narrated that Jarir bin 'Abdullah said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said to me: 'Ask the people to be quiet and listen.' Then he said: 'I do not want to see you after I am gone reverting to disbelievers, striking the necks of one another (killing one another)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-37-4132-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
